{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xLAjT5rhih1794888878.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中大醫院9月錯誤切除一名女病人的雙側卵巢。中大醫院表示高度關注，已向病人及家屬致歉，並就事件全面檢討。</p><p></p><p>衞生署指，9月13日收到一宗中大醫院呈報的醫療風險事件，指一名45歲女病人進行腹腔鏡子宮及雙側輸卵管切除手術時，被錯誤切除雙側卵巢。病人情況穩定，無證據顯示，醫院在人手、設備方面，違反實務守則要求。</p><p></p><p>另一宗涉及牙科中心的事故，中心涉認錯一名27歲女病人，為她接受洗牙治療，病人情況穩定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.307889+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:32:52.715169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:27.950955+00:00","content_hash":"401e85ef025e6f4edbc5a79bb747c4a00eaffc720972272f583e3c9b4ec70f6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.307889+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}